{
    "title": "World of Airports",
    "description": "World of Airports is a strategy game that focuses on airport management. You can take on the role of an air traffic controller while developing one of the many international airports that are accurately rendered in realistic 3D. Join a massive community of airport, airplane, and aviation enthusiasts in World of Airports. This game offers more than just the typical airport tycoon or flight simulator experience. It provides deep airplane games, airport simulators, and airline management features.\r\n\r\n\r\nBECOME AN AIRPORT MANAGER\r\n- Experience a detailed airport traffic simulation\r\n- Control air traffic and manage airport staff to ensure smooth operations\r\n- Handle other players' aircraft as part of the multiplayer experience\r\n- Enjoy stunning real 3D graphics\r\n- Earn money to upgrade your staff and airport facilities\r\n- Aim for the highest ranks in global leaderboards\r\n- Unlock new airports and airplane liveries as you progress through the game\r\n- Accomplish achievements to trigger special events at your airports\r\n\r\n\r\nBUILD YOUR AIRPLANE FLEET\r\n- Purchase airplanes for your airline and customize their appearance for other players to see\r\n- Access a wide selection of over 80 realistic airplanes\r\n- Send your planes to other players' airports\r\n- Strive to create a top-rated airline\r\n- Manage air traffic control operations\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in an incredibly realistic multiplayer airport management game where you can test your skills as an airline commander. Build your airport city and discover unique planes from around the world. As an airline manager, you must demonstrate your ability to oversee airport security, airline staff, and flight crew. Level up your team to ensure they perform their jobs even better and faster. Become an airport tycoon in this highly realistic plane simulator game!\r\n\r\nWhether you prefer the role of an airport manager or airline commander, World of Airports offers something for everyone to enjoy. Download the game now to experience firsthand how it stands out among other plane games and air traffic control games. Take on the challenge and become the ultimate airport manager!",
    "descriptionHTML": "World of Airports is a strategy game that focuses on airport management. You can take on the role of an air traffic controller while developing one of the many international airports that are accurately rendered in realistic 3D. Join a massive community of airport, airplane, and aviation enthusiasts in World of Airports. This game offers more than just the typical airport tycoon or flight simulator experience. It provides deep airplane games, airport simulators, and airline management features.<br><br><br>BECOME AN AIRPORT MANAGER<br>- Experience a detailed airport traffic simulation<br>- Control air traffic and manage airport staff to ensure smooth operations<br>- Handle other players&#39; aircraft as part of the multiplayer experience<br>- Enjoy stunning real 3D graphics<br>- Earn money to upgrade your staff and airport facilities<br>- Aim for the highest ranks in global leaderboards<br>- Unlock new airports and airplane liveries as you progress through the game<br>- Accomplish achievements to trigger special events at your airports<br><br><br>BUILD YOUR AIRPLANE FLEET<br>- Purchase airplanes for your airline and customize their appearance for other players to see<br>- Access a wide selection of over 80 realistic airplanes<br>- Send your planes to other players&#39; airports<br>- Strive to create a top-rated airline<br>- Manage air traffic control operations<br><br>Immerse yourself in an incredibly realistic multiplayer airport management game where you can test your skills as an airline commander. Build your airport city and discover unique planes from around the world. As an airline manager, you must demonstrate your ability to oversee airport security, airline staff, and flight crew. Level up your team to ensure they perform their jobs even better and faster. Become an airport tycoon in this highly realistic plane simulator game!<br><br>Whether you prefer the role of an airport manager or airline commander, World of Airports offers something for everyone to enjoy. Download the game now to experience firsthand how it stands out among other plane games and air traffic control games. Take on the challenge and become the ultimate airport manager!",
